You deserve being number
one more than anybody.

161
00:14:17,020 --> 00:14:19,577
You showed them all what
real strength's about.

162
00:14:19,660 --> 00:14:20,836
You should be proud.

163
00:14:22,260 --> 00:14:23,090
Thank you.

164
00:14:25,540 --> 00:14:26,580
Um, Asada?

165
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:28,180
What's up?

166
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:30,860
You said, you said to wait.

167
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:32,240
Remember that?

168
00:14:32,700 --> 00:14:34,288
What are you talking about?

169
00:14:35,060 --> 00:14:40,100
Well, you told me to wait, and if
I did, then you'd be mine. Huh?

170
00:14:41,240 --> 00:14:42,200
I waited.

171
00:14:42,500 --> 00:14:43,780
I waited for you.

172
00:14:44,680 --> 00:14:46,080
