173
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:51,000
From now on, I'll always be with you.

174
00:14:52,260 --> 00:14:53,997
You don't need him to protect you.

175
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,180
That's my job.

176
00:14:55,500 --> 00:14:57,300
I'm gonna protect you now.

177
00:14:58,320 --> 00:14:59,150
Forever.

178
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,430
Shinkawa!

179
00:15:09,513 --> 00:15:10,680
I love you, Asura.

180
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:11,960
You're mine.

181
00:15:12,380 --> 00:15:13,480
My Asura.

182
00:15:15,380 --> 00:15:17,120
Xenon. Mine.

183
00:15:17,660 --> 00:15:19,660
Let go!

184
00:15:26,780 --> 00:15:28,721
Why'd you push me away like that?

185
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,680
You made a promise.

186
00:15:30,980 --> 00:15:32,040
We both did.

187
00:15:34,060 --> 00:15:34,890
Shinkawa?

188
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:54,150
Shinkawa?

189
00:15:54,233 --> 00:15:55,063
Shinkawa?

190
00:15:55,160 --> 00:15:57,260
Don't make any sudden moves, Asada.

191
00:15:58,520 --> 00:16:00,497
The syringe I'm holding's got a drug in it

192
00:16:00,580 --> 00:16:03,168
that'll paralyze your
muscles in an instant.

193
00:16:03,420 --> 00:16:06,397
Before you know it, your lungs
will stop thin your heart.

194
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:07,310
Syringe?

195
00:16:07,860 --> 00:16:10,801
Maybe by injecting some
kind of drug or something?

196
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:12,080
That's one way.

197
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:14,780
Yeah, it is the family business.

198
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:18,477
I promised my dad I'd go to med
school, so it's a done deal.

199
00:16:18,560 --> 00:16:19,619
Stuck with it now.

200
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:22,160
This is crazy.

201
00:16:23,700 --> 00:16:25,320
You're the other Death Gun.

202
00:16:27,340 --> 00:16:29,260
Ooh, I'm impressed.

203
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:32,151
You figured out Death Gun's little secret.

204
00:16:32,740 --> 00:16:33,640
It's true.

205
00:16:33,980 --> 00:16:36,100
I'm Death Gun's partner in crime.

206
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:42,797
Up to now, before this year's B .O .B.

207
00:16:42,880 --> 00:16:45,520
anyway, I was the one playing Shterbin.

208
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:51,040
But today, I insisted on being
the one to do the job IRL.

209
00:16:52,100 --> 00:16:52,940
Don't you see?

210
00:16:53,140 --> 00:16:55,017
I had to be the one doing the deed.

211
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:59,360
I can't let some other guy touch
you, even if that guy's my brother.

212
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:00,980
Your brother?

213
00:17:02,660 --> 00:17:06,580
So then, the player who belonged
to that murder guild and SAO,

214
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:08,980
that was your older brother.

215
00:17:09,380 --> 00:17:10,520
Forget about him.

216
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:13,020
It's just you and me now, Asada.

217
00:17:16,540 --> 00:17:17,370
Stop!

218
00:17:17,540 --> 00:17:18,957
It's not too late.

219
00:17:19,040 --> 00:17:20,940
You don't have to do this.

220
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:23,620
What about cram school, huh?

221
00:17:24,020 --> 00:17:26,314
You said you were going to be a doctor.

222
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:29,470
Doctor?

223
00:17:29,553 --> 00:17:31,377
You think I'd give a damn about that?

224
00:17:31,460 --> 00:17:34,800
about my parents, those guys in school.

225
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:36,340
They're all assholes.

226
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:39,477
You know what would have made me happy?

227
00:17:39,560 --> 00:17:41,560
To be the strongest player in GGO.

228
00:17:41,900 --> 00:17:45,959
But that piece of shit Saxe lied
about AGI types being the strongest.

229
00:17:46,540 --> 00:17:48,600
And I fell for it like an idiot!

230
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:51,100
You don't know.

231
00:17:51,660 --> 00:17:53,420
GGO was everything to me.

232
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:57,600
And I gave everything up in the
real world for it, goddammit!

233
00:17:59,540 --> 00:18:01,280
You killed Saxe.

234
00:18:01,460 --> 00:18:02,740
Because he lied.

235
00:18:03,340 --> 00:18:04,500
Oh, come on.

236
00:18:04,740 --> 00:18:06,269
He was the perfect victim.

237
00:18:06,420 --> 00:18:09,717
We had to show the world Death
Gun was the strongest in GGO.

238
00:18:09,800 --> 00:18:11,360
In all the VR Miss.

239
00:18:11,480 --> 00:18:14,245
What better person to
sacrifice than that dork?

240
00:18:14,860 --> 00:18:18,720
And now that that's done, I
don't need this reality anymore.

241
00:18:20,020 --> 00:18:21,880
Let's move on to the next one.

242
00:18:22,380 --> 00:18:23,851
Come on, just you and me.

243
00:18:24,380 --> 00:18:25,680
What are you saying?

244
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:28,120
We can go somewhere like GGO.

245
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:30,310
No. No.

246
00:18:30,393 --> 00:18:32,277
Someplace with a fantasy vibe instead.

247
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:34,654
As long as it's with you, I don't care.

248
00:18:34,860 --> 00:18:35,860
We'll be reborn.

249
00:18:36,100 --> 00:18:37,237
Be husband and a wife.

250
00:18:37,320 --> 00:18:38,150
We'll get a house.

251
00:18:38,233 --> 00:18:39,697
We'll go on quests together.

252
00:18:39,780 --> 00:18:41,480
Oh, and have kids, too.

253
00:18:41,740 --> 00:18:43,060
It'll be so much fun.

254
00:18:43,800 --> 00:18:44,940
I know I will.

255
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,180
Come with me.

256
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:49,470
Asuna.

257
00:18:49,553 --> 00:18:50,480
You're so beautiful.

258
00:18:50,940 --> 00:18:53,240
You are more than anything.

259
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:56,500
You're mine and no one else's.

260
00:18:57,300 --> 00:18:59,860
I always loved you, Asuna. Always.

261
00:19:00,420 --> 00:19:01,250
In school,

262
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:03,077
when I heard about what happened,

263
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:04,840
when I heard what you did,

264
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:09,000
I could look all over and never
find another girl like you.

265
00:19:09,340 --> 00:19:13,940
I mean, you shot a real bad guy
with a real gun and killed him.

266
00:19:14,280 --> 00:19:15,980
How cool is that?

267
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:17,920
I told you, didn't I?

268
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:20,220
I said you had real power.

269
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:23,997
Then I came up with the Death Gun Legend.

270
00:19:24,080 --> 00:19:27,100
And I picked the Type 54
as his gun because of you.

271
00:19:28,300 --> 00:19:30,300
That's how much I love you, Asuna.

272
00:19:31,180 --> 00:19:33,000
I love you so much.

273
00:19:33,620 --> 00:19:34,920
More than anything.

274
00:19:37,460 --> 00:19:38,290
No.

275
00:19:56,140 --> 00:20:01,020
I don't want to see anything
or feel anything anymore.

276
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:05,837
This isn't real.

277
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:07,060
It can't be.

278
00:20:10,820 --> 00:20:17,120
Kirito, you went to all that trouble
to save me, but it was all for nothing.

279
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:19,100
How about this?

280
00:20:19,380 --> 00:20:21,909
After we log out, I
could head over to you.

281
00:20:22,820 --> 00:20:25,800
If he comes over, he'll be in danger.

282
00:20:27,840 --> 00:20:30,400
And I can't do anything about it.

283
00:20:31,820 --> 00:20:33,060
That's not true.

284
00:20:35,140 --> 00:20:39,199
Up to this point, all we've been
doing was looking out for ourselves.

285
00:20:39,540 --> 00:20:42,180
We certainly never fought for anyone else.

286
00:20:43,180 --> 00:20:49,060
But now, even though it might be too late
for us, let's go fight for someone else.

287
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:51,200
Just this once, me and you.

288
00:21:07,180 --> 00:21:09,160
Come on. Let's go.

289
00:21:14,100 --> 00:21:16,120
I love you, Asuna.

290
00:21:36,340 --> 00:21:37,170
Asuna!

291
00:21:37,253 --> 00:21:38,083
Asuna!

292
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:41,070
No!

293
00:21:41,153 --> 00:21:42,120
Let go of me! No!

294
00:21:45,340 --> 00:21:49,940
Asuna! Asuna! Asuna! Asuna! Asuna!

295
00:21:56,280 --> 00:21:57,110
Let's go!

296
00:21:57,193 --> 00:21:58,023
Run, Xenon!

297
00:22:03,900 --> 00:22:04,730
Kirito...

298
00:22:46,240 --> 00:22:50,560
Once again, there's no one need to go.

299
00:22:53,620 --> 00:22:57,580
I want to be stronger and stronger,

300
00:22:58,620 --> 00:23:02,100
I want to be a dream.

301
00:23:02,960 --> 00:23:04,820
I want to be a dream like this,

302
00:23:36,200 --> 00:23:38,620
Next time, one little step.
